---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>4World | Cyber-Pixel Universe</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Explora un mundo de acción y aventura en 4World." />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center">

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <main class="relative w-full max-w-5xl px-4 py-20 text-center">
      <div class="relative inline-block animate-flicker">
        <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-9xl font-bold tracking-tighter neon-text-pink mb-8 leading-tight">
          4WORLD
        </h1>
        <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-4 w-full h-full bg-pink-500 blur-[100px] opacity-20 rounded-full"></div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12 leading-relaxed">
        Un universo donde la acción no se detiene y el estilo es tu única ley. 
        Explora, lucha y construye tu legado en un mundo impulsado por la comunidad.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 justify-center mt-12">
        <a href="#play" class="px-8 py-4 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white font-bold rounded-none border-b-4 border-pink-900 transition-all active:translate-y-1 active:border-b-0">
          JUGAR AHORA
        </a>
        <a href="#about" class="px-8 py-4 border-2 border-cyan-500 text-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-500 hover:text-white font-bold transition-all active:translate-y-1">
          EXPLORAR MUNDO
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Decorative Elements -->
      <div class="mt-24 flex justify-center gap-8 items-center opacity-30 filter grayscale">
         <span class="text-sm">[ DISTRITO 4 ]</span>
         <span class="text-sm">[ RED ALERT ]</span>
         <span class="text-sm">[ SYSTEM ONLINE ]</span>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="fixed bottom-8 text-gray-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
      4World x Cyber Aesthetics &copy; 2024
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>
